+# Third-party notices
+
+## MediaPipe Pose Landmarker model (Body Scan)
+
+- **File:** `public/models/pose_landmarker_full.task`
+- **Credit:** MediaPipe Pose Landmarker (BlazePose GHUM 3D), Google, Apache-2.0
+- **Licence:** Apache License 2.0, as stated on Google's model card
+  (https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/Model%20Card%20BlazePose%20GHUM%203D.pdf).
+  Full licence text: [`licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`](licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).
+- **Source and integrity:** see `docs/body-scan-pose-model.md` (source URL, size and SHA-256).
+- The model is distributed unmodified.
+
+## @mediapipe/tasks-vision 0.10.35 (Body Scan runtime)
+
+- **Credit:** MediaPipe Tasks Vision, Google
+- **Licence:** Apache-2.0 (from the package metadata). Full text: [`licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`](licenses/Apache-2.0.txt).
+- The JavaScript and WASM files are bundled unmodified by Vite.
